{
  "name": "Repurpose one piece of content into posts for every platform",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Repurpose one piece of content into posts for every platform\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Sets the source content that guide the AI-written content.\n3. Uses OpenAI to write the post copy and parses it into per-platform fields.\n4. Publishes posts to X (Twitter), LinkedIn, Facebook, Bluesky, Mastodon, and Threads via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] In the Set source content node, set the source content to your own content.\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n\n### Customization\n\nEdit the prompt in the AI Repurposing Engine node, or change the OpenAI model, to tune the tone of the copy.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 570
      },
      "id": "68be5f3c-d1c1-47a6-b0ea-364e01f02155",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
